s: being_around_player
#
c: HasFlag('beggar_informant')
#
t: Ears open, choomba.
t: Saw two EBI suits at the taxi stand this morning. Thought you'd want to know.
t: Nobody sees the man with the cup. That's the trick.

s: being_around_player
#
c: HasFlag('beggar_helped')
#
t: Still alive, thanks to you.
t: Cold night coming.

s: being_around_player
#
t: Spare some sat?
t: Anything helps, choomba.
t: (He rattles his cup.)

s: being_damaged
#
t: I've got nothing! Nothing!
t: Please...
